WEBVTT

00:00:00.127 --> 00:00:00.667
No way. No way!

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.317
It's down!

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.833
LET'S GO! LET'S GO!

00:00:03.243 --> 00:00:04.313
Ah! I got hit!

00:00:04.383 --> 00:00:04.993
One life.

00:00:05.063 --> 00:00:06.113
One life left, chat.

00:00:06.123 --> 00:00:07.253
Nobody talk to me.

00:00:16.743 --> 00:00:17.743
It's at ten percent.

00:00:17.743 --> 00:00:18.563
Five percent.

00:00:18.563 --> 00:00:19.713
Come on, come on, come on!

00:00:20.493 --> 00:00:21.033
No way. No way!

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:21.683
It's down!

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.283
LET'S GO! LET'S GO!

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:24.333
Sector seven, done!

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:25.263
New high score!
